menu "Athena audio"

    config ATHENA_AUDIO_SR
        bool "Wake word and VAD on the microphone (ESP-SR, main/sr.c)"
        default y
        help
            The speech front end of stage 5: ESP-SR's AFE with WakeNet and
            VADNet on the same microphone blocks the client gets. It only
            logs, nothing in the stream depends on it, so a build without it
            is the raw bridge alone: main/sr.c is left out, the ESP-SR
            libraries are not linked, and core 1 carries the I2S tasks only.

            Off for a demo that needs the bridge and nothing else: set
            `# CONFIG_ATHENA_AUDIO_SR is not set` in the generated sdkconfig
            (or `CONFIG_ATHENA_AUDIO_SR=n` in sdkconfig.defaults, then
            `rm -f sdkconfig && idf.py reconfigure`), build, `idf.py app-flash`.
            The models stay in the `model` partition, so turning it back on
            is one more app-flash.

endmenu
